<title>MEXICO: Mexico stocks surge to new record on jobs data.</title>
<headline>Mexico stocks surge to new record on jobs data.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican stocks notched up their third record close of the week and extended midday gains as favorable expectations for employment data were confirmed in late trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>Preliminary figures placed the leading IPC share index  .MXX was up 40.31 points, or 1.05 percent, at a record of 3,880.04.</p>
<p>(( --Martin Roberts, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907))</p>
